      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.45,
      "end_seconds": 161.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.1,
      "end_seconds": 165.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 172.72,
      "end_seconds": 188.75,
      "duration_seconds": 16.03,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Height 185 centimetres, weight 89 kilos, temp 36.5 degrees. Pressure 95 over 63, BMI works out to 26.0, SpO2 96 percent on room air, pulse is 110 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.38,
      "end_seconds": 191.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.02,
      "end_seconds": 196.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.82,
      "end_seconds": 199.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.66,
      "end_seconds": 219.33,
      "duration_seconds": 9.67,
      "text": "The creases in your palms and your scars are darker than they should be and your blood pressure drops when you stand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.36,
      "end_seconds": 236.44,
      "duration_seconds": 13.08,
      "text": "You can relax now. Having listened and examined, I think we're dealing with possible adrenal insufficiency at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.03,
      "end_seconds": 241.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.96,
      "end_seconds": 251.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now possible adrenal insufficiency is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.58,
      "end_seconds": 295.28,
      "duration_seconds": 27.7,
      "text": "I'm sending you for a morning cortisol because of possible adrenal insufficiency. Drink fluids and eat salty foods until the results, and come in if you vomit. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Book a review after the results. Okay, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.28,
      "end_seconds": 300.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.56,
      "end_seconds": 303.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
